---
title: "invest (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_guard: whenNotPaused AND whenNotPrefundAllocationPeriod AND whenSaleNotEnded AND whenSaleNotCanceled
    q_guard --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert
    q_guard --> q_revert_alloc: in prefund allocation period
    q_revert_alloc --> [*]: revert LegionSale__PrefundAllocationPeriodNotEnded
    q_guard --> q_check_position: guards pass
    q_check_position --> q_create_pos: _getInvestorPositionId(msg.sender) == 0
    q_create_pos --> q_verify: positionId = _createInvestorPosition(msg.sender)
    q_check_position --> q_verify: positionId = s_investorPositionIds[msg.sender]
    q_verify --> q_verify_sig: _verifyInvestSignature(signature)
    q_verify_sig --> q_verify_min: _verifyMinimumInvestAmount(amount)
    q_verify_min --> q_verify_refund: _verifyHasNotRefunded(positionId)
    q_verify_refund --> q_verify_excess: _verifyHasNotClaimedExcess(positionId)
    q_verify_excess --> q_update: all verifications pass
    q_update --> q_emit: totalCapitalInvested += amount; investedCapital += amount
    q_emit --> q_transfer: emit CapitalInvested(amount, msg.sender, isPrefund, positionId)
    q_transfer --> [*]: safeTransferFrom(bidToken, msg.sender, address(this), amount)

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: totalCapitalInvested increases monotonically during sale
        INV-002: investor cannot invest after refunding
        INV-003: investor cannot invest after claiming excess
        INV-004: investment blocked during prefund allocation period
    end note
